              "name": "Section note",
              "fill": "$muted-foreground",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Wrap any focused control: 2 px ring in ring with a 2 px white gap, so it reads at 18:1 against the white gap on every fill, black, red or lime. Replace the Slot with the control instance; set cornerRadius to the control radius plus 4. On the black downloads bar or toast, set the stroke to focus-on-dark and the fill to bar. Rows use an inner 2 px stroke instead. Maps to Tailwind outline-2 outline-offset-2.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
