              "content": "Segmented control: white segment on a grey track. Item 30 px, radius 6; track muted, radius 8, 3 px padding. Item overrides: Icon, Label, Count, root fill and stroke. Selected: white fill, 1 px line edge, black 600 label (no shadow, it is not floating). Used for the type filter, calendar view, results filter and Keep seeding or Remove; when Remove would break a hit and run rule, the selected segment uses risk-soft fill and risk text. Maps to shadcn ToggleGroup type single. Track holds up to six segments: Items 1 to 3 on by default, Items 4 to 6 off; turn on as many as the filter needs (the release quality filter uses four: All, 2160p, 1080p, 720p). Never nest a frame inside the track for extra segments.",
