              "id": "y7IDT1",
              "name": "Section note",
              "fill": "$muted-foreground",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Where a decision lives sets its scale. 1. In the table: opens from a row and keeps the rows in view. Row scale only: a tinted muted band under the row, text 13, choices as a 28 px ToggleGroup or 32 px Option rows, the action a 28 px Button on the row's Actions line labelled with the outcome. No 40 or 48 px control and no card surface inside a table. Grab choice, remove from downloads, inline status, history details. 2. Page panel: opens under a page header or hero, or holds its own rows. Panel/inline with an edge and no shadow, 40 px controls, one 48 px main action. Pick a release, import by hand, change monitoring. 3. Dialog: destructive or lossy confirmations leave the flow. Dialog over Scrim. Delete a file, version or title; replace the current file; discard unsaved edits.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
