            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DoOcd",
              "name": "Section note",
              "fill": "$muted-foreground",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Title page overview band (show and movie pages). Information is grouped by what it describes. Left column: the show or film itself (overview, a three-column grid of v2/Fact/stacked, crew for movies, links, genre and keyword chips). Right column: v2/Card/library, 360 px, everything about your copy (monitoring, quality profile, files, size, added, folder, your tags). Order inside the card: the In your library heading, then the Ratings row (one entry per rating site; the Logo slot is off until real rater logos are added), then v2/Fact/row rows (label 112, value right-aligned), then the Tags row. In the page flow: card fill, 1 px border, radius 10, no shadow. Fact/stacked: label 14/600 foreground over value 14/400 muted-foreground, 2 px apart; grid rows 16 apart, columns 24 apart. Overrides: Rating 1 to 4 (Logo, Source, Value, Votes), Title, Row 1 to 8 (Label, Value), Tag list. Custom; plain markup (dl) inside a section.",
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
