              "content": "Title overview hero, same for owned and not-yet-added titles. Backdrop band (Sonarr or Radarr backdrop, fading to white) (220 px) behind a 176 by 264 poster in full colour, radius 8, 1 px inner edge. Title 36/800, plain meta line (no boxed chips), status badges, overview up to 680 px, actions, and a facts column on the right. Overrides: Backdrop fill (image), Poster fill (image), Bookmark, Title, Meta, Badges, Overview, Primary, Secondary, More, Fact 1 to 4. Custom. Built at the size the title pages use: padding 100 40 24 40, Info top padding 60, Facts top padding 136; screens override content only. Compact (page scrolled): turn Backdrop and Body off, Compact strip on, root padding 12 40 and a 1 px bottom line; one 72 px strip with a 32 by 48 poster thumb, breadcrumb over a 20/700 title, and the same three actions at the right. Set Poster thumb fill and Compact title to match the full header.",
