              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "One base row; every named row is an instance of it with its cells filled. 40 px rows (56 for two-line rows), 16 px side padding everywhere so columns line up across pages. States are overrides on the row: hover grey, selected = selected tint plus black Marker bar, risk = red Marker, warning = amber Marker, best = best-soft tint, focus = 2 px inner black edge. The Marker is a 3 px bar, off by default; set its height to the row height on taller rows. Maps to shadcn Table over TanStack Table, state via data-state.",
