              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Season header row, 48 px, opens its episodes. Columns: Chevron 20, Bookmark 28 (monitored, not, or mixed when only some episodes are monitored), Title 120, Progress 220 (bar plus on disk + downloading / total), Status 140 (Airing, Ended, Upcoming), Size 96, spacer, Actions 112. States: default, hover, pressed, focus, selected, open, mixed, not monitored, downloading.",
